    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad0404da94e75aa12dd531e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "まだまだ速くならないと…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f5e195c0785245623627c1dd31bbe40073a57d36b5b7064acc3aac9743eaf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/30001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a1a781426757b989b33e8cd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "諦めません。次はきっと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a27be61b176f77fa902d7e5735311d8e5338855969e6861b20d1e33aa49c9e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/30002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e65173dced543ddb8a0076",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "もっと速くなれるはずなのに…\r\nもっと、もっと…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd3d853658f698bba5bc1e9221822e9f5d88ae4f64028a30d79d15ed64883b24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/30003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2c747f2862f56345a1abe27",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "おれの走り、おれの全部…\r\n受け取ってもらえたかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe25c24ba56df28ce2dfdd10577824884134b94f4c13326abab282c1054cfaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/30004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d313832a3fe8413de9cece",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "みんな、勝ったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe4eade957d88fa88ffa6c2a83b503de7b9d828845a04ef8a2f3cf18607af94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/30005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9fec46d4dcf7ce56dcc378d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出し切ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7bf6a193617fbbeb7474d4664a5cb22988e5ad959cde3764ca8f207e987c47a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "31000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/31000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bd2d0339469b6252a21bb22",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ただ一瞬の、奇跡のために！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7655053130a2d94d7c15dcdde053fb1b0759c619be98b7d1e91a0672ecd3b19c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "40000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/40000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f290c175ffd711e268a3d407",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "みんなの目標が叶って、\r\n素敵な思い出作れるといいな。\r\nお手伝い、頑張ろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e366ce0eda36f6c65972d355803be30472cd6d5ff19a4fc5437890bb4fb5076",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "400004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/400004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b115bddc9bd00922d894f5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "みんなが笑顔なら嬉しい。みんなが\r\n楽しんでくれたら、それだけで…\r\nおれは本当に、いいんだけど――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00af36c9fc339a5b89e2fca83547641fcbb39b5f5c6c3e92003beb36b0395d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "400008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/400008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6589f6a526bafee885ed9c13",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "燃えろ、光れ、おれの全部――\r\nただ一瞬の、奇跡のために！",
      "source_fingerprint": "812dde67c20b4fa793637ddec66931c5c579fc9de1b9a8062d9234a29a9d5beb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "40001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/40001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:231923096e1bef0e749ab5b5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "まさかみんなで一緒に踊るなんて…\r\nふふ、まだこのへん、\r\nふわふわしてる。…楽しかったな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbfef687804b4345b8a973efa2851212872a8551076405ac082c86bc2bd8390",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "400011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/400011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2fa8ce1ce05c9ddc8bae3b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感謝の気持ち、伝えてきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5799be483a9b2209919f5e1dddeb35ac016bdd665f85a04be20ebec4668a0f56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "60000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/60000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:608158bfbc6a5357500e7669",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんにも宛てて、歌いますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5567bc878f45f4ecfd0e79b533b7ea6d0ec32643840fa22598fab3f96c2daebd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "60001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/60001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af8b92685c99192d99eddd4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "おれ、絶対“奇跡”を起こします。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88fb627d171ef763388e928811ae8831925850670f26fd656a710f8bc67c9edf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/70000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3612fb1a0b86f0ceca2e912",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "あのときのトレーナーさんの\r\n優しさが…今おれを、\r\nここに立たせてくれてるんですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45f1a0330c6593c34ef5467add8cc6dcbe6563cb6edd049cfb92615cd9808508",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/70001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594e5da4ae97f142fcbf287f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "この制服は、おれがここにいるっていう\r\n奇跡の証なんですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3094e80fe384dfaa650a30b90ce6ef576b9ca76385bee6e48f87473f484dd940",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/70004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff1c7fd7cf0a6632c18a4b3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "こんなにかわいいリボン、\r\n似合うかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2eaee00f1a20f5f565efd5fe2713e01c203f83ef51657866c24b5cfa3044eb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/70008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1e79b0be98e322a611c08c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "みんなの優しさ、努力…\r\n全部の結晶みたいな服なんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92db702f23052422ef9e18162e2c4506f97bc0aacd2b065f706d70bd49849f8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/70009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a70c6253a344379c4c5d591",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "このかけがえのない日々を、\r\n一緒に過ごす服、ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59fe9ffc39bbb89c9a528cfc530bd8bd7d217784bcd09940f8440ecccac4961b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/70010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:347217cf7a79f80032b24698",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "気が引き締まります。\r\n感謝を伝える服なので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e591a7e41de41a6c446a79e43533baf8ca2c259c4ed7d877cf936fe38d4adee6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1093/70014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbfcf671869304f47e31c93",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ところどころに星がついてて…\r\nおれも、こんなふうに光りたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "030e03d3022d4e2f7a687c0be53e60c51ce42fc213705c2e46185d6ccca63f0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
